WEBVTT

00:11.720 --> 00:13.130
<b>Come on, look at me.</b>

00:16.300 --> 00:18.300
<b>Wow, we look amazing.</b>

00:19.060 --> 00:20.310
<b>Thanks to the touch-ups.</b>

00:20.770 --> 00:22.600
<b>What, seriously?</b>

00:23.690 --> 00:25.350
<b>Oh yeah, look.</b>

00:26.270 --> 00:28.940
<b>Your nose looks much straighter.</b>

00:29.570 --> 00:31.400
<b>No need to check it in real time!</b>

00:32.320 --> 00:35.280
<b>We'll choose the photos at the signing.</b>

00:35.570 --> 00:36.610
<b>OK!</b>

02:07.620 --> 02:12.170
<b>**AND THE SKY DARKENS AGAIN**</b>

02:08.870 --> 02:09.960
<b>Are they working?</b>

02:10.460 --> 02:12.170
<b>You could have told me.</b>

02:12.540 --> 02:15.670
<b>Apparently, it's their very last day.</b>

02:16.210 --> 02:20.220
<b>They wanted to go since everything has always gone well.</b>

02:20.970 --> 02:22.680
<b>Yes, understandable.</b>

02:23.300 --> 02:24.100
<b>Sorry.</b>

02:25.100 --> 02:26.470
<b>A whim of the president.</b>

02:27.140 --> 02:29.390
<b>Having products with our name on them.</b>

02:29.730 --> 02:31.560
<b>Imagine Togenashi Togeari water.</b>

02:31.980 --> 02:34.440
<b>My throat feels dry just thinking about it.</b>

02:34.860 --> 02:37.820
<b>Well, all the papers seem to be in order.</b>

02:38.280 --> 02:42.990
<b>Which means that from now on, you'll be working with our agency.</b>

02:43.280 --> 02:47.040
<b>And I, Miura, will be your agent. I'm very proud.</b>

02:47.660 --> 02:48.540
<b>And so are we.</b>

02:48.790 --> 02:50.120
<b>Thank you.</b>

02:51.460 --> 02:54.040
<b><i>And that's how we found an agency.</i></b>

02:55.500 --> 02:56.840
<b>200,000 yen, you say?</b>

02:57.260 --> 03:00.340
<b>Yeah. Which falls on the 25th of every month, if I understood correctly.</b>

03:00.510 --> 03:01.840
<b>And we can spend it?</b>

03:02.010 --> 03:03.300
<b>Of course!</b>

03:03.550 --> 03:04.850
<b>It's our salary.</b>

03:05.140 --> 03:06.850
<b>Really?</b>

03:07.180 --> 03:10.060
<b>You didn't read the entire contract.</b>

03:10.350 --> 03:14.860
<b>Well, obviously, there are some conditions.</b>

03:15.360 --> 03:16.860
<b>Maybe one day…</b>

03:17.860 --> 03:20.320
<b>you'll have to act in an adult film!</b>

03:20.860 --> 03:23.490
<b>Because it will be in the contract!</b>

03:25.700 --> 03:26.700
<b>Calm down.</b>

03:26.870 --> 03:29.870
<b>- But you heard her, right?
- It won't happen like that.</b>

03:30.250 --> 03:33.380
<b>The agency will just take a certain percentage</b>

03:33.880 --> 03:35.290
<b>of our profits.</b>

03:35.590 --> 03:37.380
<b>Merchandise, concerts, and CDs.</b>

03:38.050 --> 03:42.180
<b>They're responsible for making us known, and if they succeed, jackpot.</b>

03:42.550 --> 03:45.390
<b>**PRICE NEGOTIABLE**</b>

03:42.930 --> 03:45.390
<b>In short, you get the picture.</b>

03:46.550 --> 03:47.760
<b>Let's hope we make it big.</b>

03:48.180 --> 03:50.640
<b>It's rare to see you so hesitant.</b>

03:51.100 --> 03:54.270
<b>It's the festival that's bothering you, right?</b>

03:54.480 --> 03:56.610
<b>If you didn't stay glued to social media…</b>

03:56.770 --> 03:59.900
<b>I can't help it! We gave an amazing performance!</b>

04:00.440 --> 04:03.280
<b>But online, it's all about DD!</b>

04:04.030 --> 04:06.160
<b>Even though we did way better!</b>

04:06.450 --> 04:08.080
<b>Calm down, I said.</b>

04:08.240 --> 04:10.620
<b>We weren't even performing on the same stage.</b>

04:11.620 --> 04:13.710
<b>And let's not forget we're talking about idols</b>

04:13.870 --> 04:16.580
<b>who put on an incredible show.</b>

04:16.790 --> 04:18.420
<b>It's normal that they get the buzz.</b>

04:18.840 --> 04:21.630
<b>We also rocked it, so why?</b>

04:21.800 --> 04:22.800
<b>I don't know.</b>

04:23.170 --> 04:27.140
<b>But we still got a good reception.</b>

04:27.510 --> 04:30.560
<b>- Look, we signed with an agency.
- Yes, but…</b>

04:31.020 --> 04:33.560
<b>Anyway, stop searching for our name online.</b>

04:34.560 --> 04:35.100
<b>Alright.</b>

04:35.440 --> 04:38.690
<b>Don't get worked up. We're just starting out.</b>

04:40.030 --> 04:40.610
<b>You're right.</b>

04:41.400 --> 04:43.780
<b>As if you didn't stress about it too.</b>

04:45.280 --> 04:45.780
<b>Ouch!</b>

04:46.490 --> 04:48.830
<b>**GYUDON**</b>

04:48.120 --> 04:48.830
<b>Here.</b>

04:50.910 --> 04:52.620
<b>Your contracts.</b>

04:53.790 --> 04:56.710
<b>Congratulations on your last day, by the way.</b>

04:57.500 --> 04:58.290
<b>What's this?</b>

04:58.630 --> 05:00.500
<b>Just take it.</b>

05:00.670 --> 05:02.800
<b>What can I get you?</b>

05:03.340 --> 05:06.470
<b>- A medium set.
- Weren't we supposed to have a hot pot?</b>

05:06.890 --> 05:09.720
<b>- Same, with a beer.
- What, you're going to drink?</b>

05:09.890 --> 05:12.470
<b>Don't worry, I'll have another tonight too.</b>

05:14.850 --> 05:16.310
<b>Alright, a medium set for me too.</b>

05:16.730 --> 05:18.060
<b>Okay, coming right up.</b>

05:18.940 --> 05:20.980
<b>This was our usual place.</b>

05:21.150 --> 05:24.990
<b>It's where I bought you food for the first time.</b>

05:25.280 --> 05:25.990
<b>Oh yeah?</b>

05:26.360 --> 05:29.410
<b>You took forever to get here from the station,</b>

05:29.700 --> 05:31.990
<b>whining about your keys or something.</b>

05:32.410 --> 05:34.120
<b>You have zero sense of direction.</b>

05:34.290 --> 05:36.120
<b><i>Thank you. Beni-Shoga forever!</i></b>

05:37.250 --> 05:38.040
<b>Tomo.</b>

05:40.040 --> 05:41.340
<b>We did a good job.</b>

05:41.960 --> 05:45.130
<b>You too. Even though the hardest part is yet to come.</b>

05:46.720 --> 05:51.640
<b>And now, let's toast to signing the contract!</b>

05:53.680 --> 05:54.390
<b>Wait, what?</b>

05:54.850 --> 05:59.020
<b>They should be here soon, they're coming after work.</b>

05:59.190 --> 06:00.020
<b>Ah, OK.</b>

06:00.310 --> 06:03.270
<b>They had a lot to wrap up.</b>

06:04.570 --> 06:05.780
<b>Ouch, ouch.</b>

06:06.190 --> 06:10.370
<b>I didn't know squash was so hard to cut.</b>

06:11.450 --> 06:13.280
<b>The snob is back.</b>

06:13.740 --> 06:15.950
<b>Stop it already.</b>

06:16.160 --> 06:18.080
<b>We’ve talked about this.</b>

06:19.420 --> 06:20.210
<b>About what?</b>

06:20.750 --> 06:24.090
<b>Well, maybe deep down, you're not wrong.</b>

06:24.840 --> 06:29.220
<b>After all, you taught me a lot when I first arrived.</b>

06:30.010 --> 06:32.600
<b>It really shocked me, you know.</b>

06:32.850 --> 06:35.350
<b>To realize I couldn't do anything,</b>

06:35.680 --> 06:39.190
<b>that I didn't know much about life.</b>

06:39.770 --> 06:41.650
<b>Are you doing better now?</b>

06:42.230 --> 06:43.230
<b>I think so, yes.</b>

06:43.610 --> 06:45.320
<b>At least not with the guitar.</b>

06:46.070 --> 06:47.570
<b>And are you okay with that?</b>

06:48.280 --> 06:52.070
<b>I want everyone to be okay with it.</b>

06:52.700 --> 06:53.450
<b>Alright.</b>

06:54.910 --> 06:56.410
<b>Here we are!</b>

06:57.000 --> 06:58.660
<b>Sorry for the wait.</b>

06:58.960 --> 06:59.790
<b>It's freezing in here.</b>

07:00.000 --> 07:01.580
<b>Worse than outside!</b>

07:01.960 --> 07:04.380
<b>Great! <i>Beer, beer!</i></b>

07:04.540 --> 07:05.590
<b>The alcoholic…</b>

07:06.710 --> 07:10.340
<b>I wanted to tell you, I've been working on our logo.</b>

07:11.930 --> 07:13.220
<b>Cheers!</b>

07:14.510 --> 07:17.100
<b>Hey, wait for us!</b>

07:17.350 --> 07:20.060
<b>We didn't even make a toast!</b>

07:20.980 --> 07:22.350
<b>They're not listening to you.</b>

07:22.730 --> 07:23.650
<b>It's annoying.</b>

07:23.810 --> 07:25.650
<b>Well, we shouldn't deprive ourselves.</b>

07:25.860 --> 07:27.360
<b>True.</b>

07:28.610 --> 07:32.070
<b>I like Chinese cabbage when it's really tender.</b>

07:32.280 --> 07:34.370
<b>- Me too. - See!</b>

07:34.740 --> 07:36.740
<b>You guys are so annoying!</b>

07:37.120 --> 07:38.290
<b>To each their own.</b>

07:38.450 --> 07:39.790
<b>- Yeah. - Shut up.</b>

07:39.950 --> 07:42.080
<b>It's much better when it's more cooked.</b>

07:42.250 --> 07:43.500
<b>Here we go.</b>

07:43.670 --> 07:45.250
<b>It falls apart afterward.</b>

07:45.540 --> 07:47.710
<b>I'm going to change your mind, just watch.</b>

07:48.130 --> 07:49.130
<b>Try it.</b>

07:50.090 --> 07:52.470
<b>- Come on, make an effort. - It's too hot!</b>

07:52.630 --> 07:56.220
<b>- Let's go together. - It's burning, I tell you!</b>

07:57.100 --> 07:58.260
<b>What's up?</b>

07:59.350 --> 08:00.520
<b>I have an idea for a song.</b>

08:02.350 --> 08:03.600
<b>I've got the title.</b>

08:04.560 --> 08:06.900
<b>**A FEW DAYS LATER**</b>

08:08.360 --> 08:09.900
<b>This looks awesome!</b>

08:11.490 --> 08:12.650
<b>Good morning.</b>

08:13.280 --> 08:14.860
<b>This is Nakata, the sound engineer.</b>

08:15.370 --> 08:17.160
<b>Nice to meet you.</b>

08:17.620 --> 08:18.910
<b>Likewise.</b>

08:19.330 --> 08:21.120
<b>And this is his assistant, Nakano.</b>

08:21.660 --> 08:22.620
<b>Pleased to meet you.</b>

08:23.460 --> 08:24.960
<b>Tanaka, journalist.</b>

08:25.250 --> 08:26.170
<b>Nice to meet you.</b>

08:26.500 --> 08:28.460
<b>Finally, Tano from marketing.</b>

08:28.800 --> 08:29.800
<b>Good morning!</b>

08:30.340 --> 08:31.050
<b>What?</b>

08:31.720 --> 08:34.050
<b>I'll never remember all these names.</b>

08:34.220 --> 08:36.930
<b>Well, it's part of the job.</b>

08:37.350 --> 08:39.430
<b>Because you remember them, right?</b>

08:39.930 --> 08:43.730
<b>Of course. That's what being an adult is all about, my dear.</b>

08:44.060 --> 08:46.650
<b>Tell me the sound engineer's name, then.</b>

08:46.900 --> 08:47.690
<b>Tanaka.</b>

08:47.860 --> 08:48.730
<b><i>No, Nakata.</i></b>

08:49.980 --> 08:51.030
<b>Sorry.</b>

08:52.110 --> 08:52.940
<b>Don't laugh.</b>

08:53.360 --> 08:56.870
<b>If I'm not mistaken, it's the song from the other day?</b>

08:57.120 --> 08:59.450
<b>I tried scribbling down some lyrics.</b>

09:00.200 --> 09:01.040
<b>Here.</b>

09:01.580 --> 09:03.040
<b>Aren't you done yet?</b>

09:03.250 --> 09:04.040
<b>Sorry.</b>

09:07.580 --> 09:08.960
<b>Wait, this title…</b>

09:09.250 --> 09:09.790
<b>Yeah.</b>

09:10.300 --> 09:12.210
<b>It's about you.</b>

09:12.800 --> 09:15.970
<b><i>I thought our first song</i></b>

09:16.590 --> 09:19.140
<b><i>should put us in the spotlight.</i></b>

09:20.390 --> 09:21.220
<b>Momoka…</b>

09:21.600 --> 09:23.480
<b>Alright, shall we start?</b>

09:24.230 --> 09:24.810
<b>Nina.</b>

09:26.060 --> 09:29.480
<b>Put your heart into it if you really want to overshadow DD.</b>

09:30.770 --> 09:31.360
<b>I promise.</b>

09:32.280 --> 09:35.360
<b><i>For the first time, we're creating a song as a group of five.</i></b>

09:54.300 --> 09:55.630
<b><i>Objective: the Budokan!</i></b>

10:17.200 --> 10:19.030
<b>**BUDOKAN**</b>

10:26.910 --> 10:28.670
<b>Is it too crowded?</b>

10:29.000 --> 10:31.000
<b>You think so? I like it this way.</b>

10:31.380 --> 10:35.010
<b>We could move this verse to the beginning.</b>

10:35.170 --> 10:37.050
<b>Well, that's an option.</b>

10:37.470 --> 10:40.050
<b>Not a bad idea. Let's try it again.</b>

10:40.510 --> 10:43.720
<b>Sorry, but we can't linger too long.</b>

10:44.220 --> 10:45.180
<b>Understood.</b>

10:45.350 --> 10:48.690
<b>**HEIWAJIMA STATION**</b>

10:46.810 --> 10:48.440
<b>We did well.</b>

10:49.140 --> 10:50.020
<b>See you later.</b>

10:50.270 --> 10:51.940
<b>I'll send you a message.</b>

10:53.270 --> 10:55.190
<b>Anyway, it was super fun.</b>

10:55.440 --> 10:56.070
<b>What was?</b>

10:56.530 --> 11:00.070
<b>Composing a song together.</b>

11:00.530 --> 11:04.330
<b>Just imagining that it could touch someone…</b>

11:04.830 --> 11:06.790
<b>It doesn't happen just like that.</b>

11:07.040 --> 11:10.710
<b>And sometimes, it doesn't achieve the success we hope for.</b>

11:11.170 --> 11:12.380
<b>It'll work out.</b>

11:13.130 --> 11:16.300
<b>I mean, we're doing everything we can.</b>

11:17.380 --> 11:18.260
<b>We'll succeed.</b>

11:22.800 --> 11:24.720
<b>I don't know, something's bothering me.</b>

11:25.350 --> 11:27.520
<b><i>Do you want to listen and see?</i></b>

11:28.600 --> 11:29.310
<b>Yes.</b>

11:30.230 --> 11:32.020
<b>By the way, where's Miura?</b>

11:32.190 --> 11:34.520
<b>She stepped out to take a call.</b>

11:35.270 --> 11:38.860
<b>We need her opinion. Can you go get her?</b>

11:39.240 --> 11:39.990
<b>OK.</b>

11:42.490 --> 11:44.410
<b>- Miura…
- DD?</b>

11:44.570 --> 11:45.490
<b>Really?</b>

11:46.080 --> 11:48.700
<b>Alright, I'll call you back later.</b>

11:51.540 --> 11:55.500
<b>Momoka would like you to see how it sounds.</b>

11:56.340 --> 11:58.710
<b>Did you hear?</b>

11:59.340 --> 11:59.880
<b>Yes.</b>

12:00.590 --> 12:01.510
<b>Too bad.</b>

12:02.380 --> 12:05.050
<b>You were talking about Diamond Dust, right?</b>

12:07.180 --> 12:10.270
<b>**VALENTINE'S DAY BATTLE!**</b>

12:07.560 --> 12:10.270
<b>I just received this a moment ago.</b>

12:10.640 --> 12:12.100
<b>Two concerts at Club Citta.</b>

12:12.270 --> 12:14.190
<b>Day one, Diamond Dust.</b>

12:14.440 --> 12:16.060
<b>Day two, Togenashi Togeari.</b>

12:16.610 --> 12:19.030
<b>Seriously? A venue that big?</b>

12:19.400 --> 12:24.160
<b>They’re planning it for February, just in time for our new songs.</b>

12:24.700 --> 12:26.950
<b>For Valentine's Day.</b>

12:27.280 --> 12:28.450
<b>I'm in.</b>

12:28.740 --> 12:29.950
<b>Ready and eager.</b>

12:30.660 --> 12:32.370
<b>Read the next page.</b>

12:33.920 --> 12:37.420
<b>The group that makes the most sales and attracts the biggest crowd</b>

12:37.630 --> 12:40.590
<b>will be chosen to perform the theme song for a drama series.</b>

12:41.210 --> 12:42.170
<b>Well…</b>

12:42.380 --> 12:43.720
<b>Not lucky.</b>

12:44.680 --> 12:45.550
<b>What?</b>

12:45.720 --> 12:47.300
<b>**CAFÉ MARUFUKU**</b>

12:46.430 --> 12:47.300
<b>A lost cause?</b>

12:47.640 --> 12:50.100
<b>Why are you being so defeatist?</b>

12:50.270 --> 12:51.930
<b>- Get it together…
- Stop.</b>

12:52.520 --> 12:55.440
<b>DD's subscribers have literally doubled.</b>

12:55.940 --> 12:56.940
<b>It's already decided.</b>

12:59.020 --> 13:02.490
<b>That's exactly why we were chosen, you know.</b>

13:02.900 --> 13:07.450
<b>So they can boast about winning.</b>

13:07.990 --> 13:09.030
<b>But still…</b>

13:09.450 --> 13:12.200
<b>we’ll be facing each other on the same stage.</b>

13:12.450 --> 13:15.830
<b>We just need to set the crowd on fire like we did at the festival!</b>

13:16.210 --> 13:17.460
<b>Think a bit.</b>

13:17.670 --> 13:18.250
<b>What do you mean?</b>

13:18.710 --> 13:22.960
<b>The catch is that we won’t be performing for the same audience.</b>

13:23.470 --> 13:26.430
<b>It's a showdown, but indirectly.</b>

13:26.800 --> 13:31.390
<b>The crowd we bring is what's important. That's all.</b>

13:31.930 --> 13:34.350
<b>The more famous band wins.</b>

13:34.520 --> 13:35.850
<b>But it's not fair.</b>

13:36.440 --> 13:38.150
<b>Getting angry won’t change anything.</b>

13:38.730 --> 13:42.650
<b>What do you think the DD members think about it?</b>

13:43.360 --> 13:44.190
<b>No idea.</b>

13:45.400 --> 13:47.360
<b>They couldn't care less.</b>

13:47.660 --> 13:50.830
<b>Well, knowing Hina, that’s probably true.</b>

13:51.330 --> 13:54.910
<b>Exploiting others is her thing.</b>

13:55.660 --> 13:58.000
<b>This might lead to a dispute.</b>

13:58.330 --> 13:59.750
<b>And is that a bad thing?</b>

14:00.090 --> 14:02.300
<b>We often see such scenes on TV.</b>

14:02.630 --> 14:04.760
<b>Throwing your drink in someone's face…</b>

14:04.920 --> 14:06.130
<b>I've seen that before.</b>

14:06.510 --> 14:08.470
<b>Really?</b>

14:08.720 --> 14:11.550
<b>- Well then…
- … we just need to vote.</b>

14:12.140 --> 14:13.890
<b>Who wants to participate?</b>

14:14.930 --> 14:16.770
<b>Who prefers to abstain?</b>

14:21.480 --> 14:22.360
<b>Understood.</b>

14:22.730 --> 14:27.400
<b>We discussed it together, and we think it's premature.</b>

14:27.570 --> 14:29.490
<b>We need a bit more time.</b>

14:30.240 --> 14:31.240
<b>Of course.</b>

14:31.660 --> 14:34.950
<b>I’ll inform them of your decision.</b>

14:35.370 --> 14:36.250
<b>Thank you.</b>

14:36.580 --> 14:39.000
<b>And what did you think?</b>

14:39.460 --> 14:40.130
<b>Nina.</b>

14:42.290 --> 14:43.960
<b>Honestly, I was torn.</b>

14:44.460 --> 14:46.630
<b>I didn’t see us winning,</b>

14:47.170 --> 14:51.760
<b>but challenging DD would have been great publicity for you.</b>

14:52.140 --> 14:52.800
<b>But then…</b>

14:53.350 --> 14:56.980
<b>The problem is, if they beat you badly,</b>

14:57.140 --> 15:00.690
<b>you’ll look like an unpopular band.</b>

15:02.020 --> 15:05.030
<b>That's the point, right?</b>

15:05.360 --> 15:07.990
<b>To pull ourselves up or to drag ourselves down.</b>

15:08.150 --> 15:10.660
<b>Impossible to know what's going on.</b>

15:11.410 --> 15:12.700
<b>It's impossible to be sure.</b>

15:15.490 --> 15:17.080
<b>I'm exhausted…</b>

15:17.250 --> 15:19.460
<b>You always have to be cautious about everything.</b>

15:19.960 --> 15:21.830
<b>That's what being an adult is.</b>

15:23.000 --> 15:23.630
<b>What?</b>

15:24.170 --> 15:26.460
<b>Do you think it's worth trying?</b>

15:28.050 --> 15:31.180
<b>I just wonder if this is what being a pro is like.</b>

15:31.340 --> 15:33.550
<b>You're the one who wanted this life.</b>

15:34.550 --> 15:35.470
<b>Here we are again.</b>

15:35.640 --> 15:37.180
<b>I don't like it.</b>

15:37.600 --> 15:40.440
<b>What if we go back to the previous version?</b>

15:40.980 --> 15:43.440
<b>No, that didn't work either.</b>

15:43.770 --> 15:47.320
<b>At this point, we might as well rewrite everything.</b>

15:47.780 --> 15:48.990
<b>Yeah, true.</b>

15:49.190 --> 15:50.530
<b>Are you sure?</b>

15:50.700 --> 15:52.320
<b>What, this verse again?</b>

15:52.740 --> 15:57.080
<b>The same one. I don't know, it sounds a bit old-fashioned.</b>

15:57.450 --> 16:01.410
<b>You think? It's true that alterations are trendy now.</b>

16:04.380 --> 16:05.250
<b>Like this?</b>

16:05.420 --> 16:06.090
<b>That's it.</b>

16:06.840 --> 16:07.750
<b>Momoka.</b>

16:08.460 --> 16:09.090
<b>What?</b>

16:09.710 --> 16:11.800
<b>You're overthinking it.</b>

16:11.970 --> 16:15.600
<b>You're straying further and further from the original idea.</b>

16:15.890 --> 16:19.890
<b>I mean, it's a song you want to dedicate to us, right?</b>

16:20.060 --> 16:22.350
<b>Maybe it's already great as it is.</b>

16:23.020 --> 16:27.480
<b>The important thing is whether you want it to represent us or not.</b>

16:27.650 --> 16:30.150
<b>That's the key.</b>

16:31.400 --> 16:34.160
<b>See you tomorrow, then.</b>

16:34.700 --> 16:36.370
<b>See you tomorrow.</b>

16:38.200 --> 16:38.870
<b>Hey.</b>

16:39.790 --> 16:40.410
<b>Yes?</b>

16:41.200 --> 16:45.380
<b>I want to be able to measure up to DD.</b>

16:46.880 --> 16:50.130
<b>I know it involves a lot.</b>

16:50.760 --> 16:54.510
<b>But it's also a chance to be the headliner.</b>

16:54.970 --> 16:58.260
<b>- To play our songs.
- That's one way to look at it…</b>

16:58.430 --> 17:01.060
<b>Exactly, we should go for it!</b>

17:01.310 --> 17:05.900
<b>And not back down when an opportunity comes our way.</b>

17:06.400 --> 17:07.440
<b>Like that…</b>

17:08.440 --> 17:09.690
<b>… we'll crash and burn.</b>

17:10.650 --> 17:11.230
<b>Yeah.</b>

17:12.110 --> 17:14.400
<b>Are you still against it, Momoka?</b>

17:19.160 --> 17:20.910
<b>The decision is yours.</b>

17:21.450 --> 17:26.080
<b>You're the one with history with Diamond Dust.</b>

17:27.000 --> 17:30.800
<b>I assume you girls are in?</b>

17:31.840 --> 17:32.920
<b>What do you choose?</b>

17:33.970 --> 17:36.300
<b>**CONSECRATION**</b>

17:35.470 --> 17:36.300
<b>It's cold.</b>

17:36.720 --> 17:38.970
<b>You think? I'm fine.</b>

17:39.140 --> 17:41.220
<b>Yeah, perfect autumn weather.</b>

17:41.390 --> 17:43.980
<b>What? Yeah, you're definitely from the north.</b>

17:44.140 --> 17:46.560
<b>My legs are bare!</b>

17:46.940 --> 17:48.270
<b>Poor little high schooler.</b>

17:48.440 --> 17:50.360
<b>Come on, spit it out.</b>

17:50.690 --> 17:51.650
<b>Annoying.</b>

17:51.820 --> 17:54.570
<b>You live nearby, right, Nina?</b>

17:54.740 --> 17:57.070
<b>Why are you taking us to a shrine?</b>

17:57.490 --> 18:00.780
<b>I thought it was the right time to visit.</b>

18:01.030 --> 18:03.750
<b>You want to pray, then.</b>

18:04.000 --> 18:04.830
<b>Why not.</b>

18:05.080 --> 18:09.290
<b>Did you ever go for New Year's with your group?</b>

18:09.460 --> 18:10.500
<b>No, never.</b>

18:10.750 --> 18:15.420
<b>We never really had the time, and it wasn't my thing.</b>

18:15.970 --> 18:17.010
<b>Yeah, that's normal.</b>

18:17.630 --> 18:21.140
<b>But today, we could use all the help we can get.</b>

18:21.300 --> 18:22.600
<b>If the gods exist.</b>

18:24.720 --> 18:26.600
<b>What's wrong, Momoka?</b>

18:27.350 --> 18:30.440
<b>You've been on edge lately.</b>

18:30.980 --> 18:33.150
<b>Is that what’s bothering you?</b>

18:33.440 --> 18:35.320
<b>It's just this composition that's…</b>

18:35.490 --> 18:36.110
<b>Liar.</b>

18:37.030 --> 18:39.490
<b>You need to be honest with us.</b>

18:43.580 --> 18:44.660
<b>I'm scared.</b>

18:45.500 --> 18:48.210
<b>The more I get involved in our compositions,</b>

18:48.500 --> 18:51.420
<b>the more anxiety tightens my throat.</b>

18:52.420 --> 18:54.630
<b>I'm afraid of losing everything.</b>

18:56.170 --> 18:57.050
<b>I knew it.</b>

18:57.630 --> 18:59.300
<b>I knew you were freaking out.</b>

19:00.340 --> 19:03.560
<b>We're all on our own in this world.</b>

19:04.430 --> 19:06.180
<b>But we have music.</b>

19:06.600 --> 19:10.560
<b>And your passion still lives in me.</b>

19:11.190 --> 19:14.270
<b>It's what led me to you.</b>

19:15.530 --> 19:19.320
<b>I believe in this fire that burns within me and in our music.</b>

19:20.160 --> 19:22.570
<b>So you, too, should trust yourself.</b>

19:23.370 --> 19:26.950
<b>I want to build the legend of Togenashi Togeari.</b>

19:27.330 --> 19:31.420
<b>To pursue the same dream together, all five of us.</b>

19:33.250 --> 19:36.590
<b>I believe in the god of rock.</b>

19:41.430 --> 19:42.550
<b>I hope, anyway.</b>

19:43.510 --> 19:46.850
<b>If he existed, what would you ask him for?</b>

19:47.770 --> 19:50.310
<b><i>To sell a million CDs, what else?</i></b>

19:50.810 --> 19:53.060
<b><i>Let's aim big, ten million!</i></b>

19:53.690 --> 19:55.860
<b><i>Even more! A hundred million!</i></b>

19:57.650 --> 20:01.110
<b><i>I just want to beat DD.</i></b>

20:03.660 --> 20:04.620
<b>Momoka.</b>

20:05.160 --> 20:05.870
<b>What?</b>

20:09.700 --> 20:11.330
<b>There you go.</b>

20:11.830 --> 20:14.330
<b>What do you think? Any thoughts?</b>

20:15.210 --> 20:16.840
<b>It seems good to me.</b>

20:17.300 --> 20:20.090
<b>I think so too. It's what sounds best.</b>

20:20.470 --> 20:21.590
<b>I like it as well.</b>

20:24.590 --> 20:28.600
<b>I rarely give my opinion on what I record.</b>

20:29.430 --> 20:30.100
<b>Understandable.</b>

20:30.480 --> 20:34.730
<b>But I really think this is the best version.</b>

20:35.150 --> 20:37.650
<b>It meets all your requirements.</b>

20:38.270 --> 20:41.240
<b>After these weeks together, I can confidently say</b>

20:41.400 --> 20:43.360
<b>that this song represents you.</b>

20:44.240 --> 20:45.370
<b>Really?</b>

20:46.320 --> 20:48.990
<b>It was a pleasure working on it.</b>

20:49.620 --> 20:52.080
<b>Helping groups like yours</b>

20:52.250 --> 20:54.750
<b>gives meaning to this job.</b>

20:56.210 --> 20:56.750
<b>Know that.</b>

20:57.710 --> 20:59.000
<b>That's kind, thank you.</b>

21:00.420 --> 21:02.510
<b>Thank you very much, Tanaka!</b>

21:02.670 --> 21:03.550
<b>Nakata.</b>

21:05.140 --> 21:09.350
<b>I'll keep you updated on the progress.</b>

21:09.680 --> 21:12.020
<b>When will it be released online?</b>

21:12.390 --> 21:16.310
<b>If all goes well, it's scheduled for early next month.</b>

21:16.810 --> 21:17.360
<b>With that, I'll be off.</b>

21:19.860 --> 21:21.190
<b>I love it too.</b>

21:21.570 --> 21:23.570
<b>It's definitely going to be a hit.</b>

21:25.160 --> 21:26.110
<b>Miura!</b>

21:27.200 --> 21:27.820
<b>Yes?</b>

21:28.490 --> 21:29.910
<b>Thanks for everything.</b>

21:30.620 --> 21:32.250
<b>Thank you so much.</b>

21:33.660 --> 21:37.380
<b>Save your thanks for later. The hardest part is yet to come.</b>

21:38.000 --> 21:38.540
<b>See you soon.</b>

21:49.260 --> 21:50.310
<b>I'm freezing.</b>

21:55.480 --> 21:56.560
<b>Alright then.</b>

21:58.770 --> 22:00.020
<b>God of rock,</b>

22:00.440 --> 22:04.570
<b>I want a billion views… no, even ten thousand would be enough.</b>

22:06.320 --> 22:07.070
<b>Please.</b>

22:07.570 --> 22:09.660
<b>Please! I'm begging you!</b>

22:14.370 --> 22:15.960
<b>**103 VIEWS**</b>

22:19.130 --> 22:20.290
<b>You’ve got to be kidding…</b>

22:27.430 --> 22:29.890
<b>Nina Iseri: Rina Momoka Kawaragi: Yûri</b>

22:31.510 --> 22:34.890
<b>Subaru Awa: Mirei Tomo Ebizuka: Natsu</b>

22:35.930 --> 22:39.310
<b>Rupa: Shuri Hina: Reina Kondô</b>

23:43.040 --> 23:46.050
<b>Translation & Subtitling: JSICMF Proofreading: Sarah Courchay</b>

23:47.420 --> 23:50.300
<b><i>Next: "Rock never dies."</i></b>
